// Title: Sysmon Configuration Error
// ID: 815cd91b-7dbc-4247-841a-d7dd1392b0a8
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2021-06-04
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1564
// Description: Detects when an adversary is trying to hide it's action from Sysmon logging based on error messages
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(Description ICONTAINS "Failed to open service configuration with error") OR where(Description ICONTAINS "Failed to connect to the driver to update configuration"))) AND NOT ((((where(Description ICONTAINS "Failed to open service configuration with error 19") OR where(Description ICONTAINS "Failed to open service configuration with error 93"))) OR ((where(Description ICONTAINS "Failed to open service configuration with error") AND where(Description ICONTAINS "Last error: The media is write protected."))) OR ((where(Description ICONTAINS "Failed to open service configuration with error") AND where(Description ICONTAINS "Last error: Média protégé en écriture."))))))
